e</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-31] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/a62b7593d1b6c2420c8467af720c84ff82d6669f\">a62b7593</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/19114\">BT#19114</a>) Plugin: Signature: Exercise: fix iId to iid in the signature plugin to make it work again</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-31] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/efc14f9ce9ec88dd3708e80aed1e06d4a5c1aeee\">efc14f9c</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/9859\">BT#9859</a>) Admin: CSV import: Force auth_source update for teachers</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-31] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/4eed487f70b5858382f5ab37e6c7249624091f03\">4eed487f</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/9859\">BT#9859</a>) Admin: CSV import: Force auth_source update</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-30] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/12d570bd4aa094466036a6f6b61f29ea924b2d32\">12d570bd</a>) Security: Remove cleaning $isFirstLogin, to avoid disconnects https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/8e0d4032082d2259ed84f4976ad1c19a40868a24#commitcomment-55631910</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-26] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/e62d59aca6a9ade07a9010b2eec96abdfac5fb19\">e62d59ac</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/18258\">BT#18258</a>) Exercise: Improve code to add/remove link and clean user upload_answer folder</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        <h3>Stylesheets and theming</h3>\r\n        <ul aria-live=\"off\">\r\n            <li>[2022-10-06] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/9f5ac6e347dd566a869d5d78ef2266af04dcd3ef\">9f5ac6e3</a>) Display: Fix banner image display for various themes and minors visual fixes for this</li>\r\n            <li>[2023-01-18] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/03c7b4750ab99cb5680a34b28dfed0602f421387\">03c7b475</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/20362\">BT#2036