[493.497452, "o", ": add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-05] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/08b1ae871013660e8f5dd635fc6a064b56286fc3\">08b1ae87</a>) Forum: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-05] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f94d9f6ed709ee93629f1c0654a2a17e2a3042a3\">f94d9f6e</a>) Exercise: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-05] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/9b16ad40dfb0233f7b461df0b39fc610dba9f26d\">9b16ad40</a>) Announcements: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-05] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/094fef4af478d71f0b5488b58ceb260376df28f0\">094fef4a</a>) Course description: Add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-03] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/cedce09205408e348811318146c5b9c4c45c9c96\">cedce092</a>) Session: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-03] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/95eef5d3245ec41c2ade4285b4a1b192c29bed9a\">95eef5d3</a>) Notebook: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-03] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/df68cef1551ee43af5631fc55cc15d55093e1163\">df68cef1</a>) Survey: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-02] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/93c087fb3f58198f9fa77be9dfb3ed3300439f44\">93c087fb</a>) Group: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-02] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/0d8c731a9784ab263aba9ac6bbf056b34c4f3cb2\">0d8c731a</a>) Forum: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-02] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/41963f1ddd6012c55b71433444c10346dd9a26a8\">41963f1d</a>) Agenda: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-08-02] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/278416857838f80a15c2efb09872fd1529cd6725\">27841685</a>) Course progress: add remove_xss</li>\r\n            