eznest.com/issues/14744\">BT#14744</a>) Admin: Disable copy session course to the same course</li>\r\n            <li>[2018-08-11] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/45ff6b6d89a9096061a03f2326363"]
