 href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/6066fb86be967d94841724f0a8a2076253b6dc99\">6066fb86</a>) Swap Skill Wheel colors</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/"]
