lo/chamilo-lms/commit/3df995697e387723fd0530bc0ed3a1e2aa8d35e4\">3df99569</a>) Use CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS in v1.10 migration script on c_lp_category</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo"]
