o-lms/commit/f701abf01c25a85b54a58ca20dc0641ba29a272b\">f701abf0</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/11048\">BT#11048</a>) Fix condition to generate skills so it doesn't depend on certificates</li>\r\n "]
