all form but still checking Mysql special characters required in CT3266 -refs CT7969</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f2bbce9d62443de58a52d443c663b5f47507fa17\">f2bbce9d</a>"]
[495.304578, "o", ") Fix search line visibility in exercises results table</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/be05ad25301b592c4f7e93c74ac05141d1a24722\">be05ad25</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/7942\">#7942</a>) Fix user can't change email when enter password</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/9e5f74aabd1737a443b9844a5d3dc45274cc2823\">9e5f74aa</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/7930\">#7930</a>) Fix user image see  #7930</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/a5b20ed8f5b1103ddc9a7d1001051e2a5aa36427\">a5b20ed8</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/7930\">#7930</a>) Fix avatar</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/0ac8d56a2baca3827b943fef4e286c3572080f47\">0ac8d56a</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/7972\">#7972</a>) Show forums on LP view</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/4aa2258e9d1b71245b8ac0fcf5f7e0363de21cd8\">4aa2258e</a>) Add Nginx config lines to install doc</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/7ca48ec35ddf29b45dfe4a19c8c7bf38776be492\">7ca48ec3</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/10563\">#10563</a>) Added new feature to payouts and comissions to the buy course plugin</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f6e320b616c45727d066cf084ad3808644c484d4\">f6e320b6</a>) Added new reports to courses and sessions to the user</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/764618216a07f1c5ab219ab482bb9777c4975cee\">76461821</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/7970\">#7970</a>) Add new indexes on extra_field and extra_field_values</li>\r\n        <li>(<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/7c57a30957ec57142f8ce3b2a5304335787b59f7\">7c57a309</a> - <a href=\