nd of exercise</li>\r\n    <li>(#6913) Teacher cannot use the Student View when working on Closed course</li>\r\n    <li>(#6914) Groups from classes option disappeared</li>\r\n    <li>(#6917) Error in file /main/inc/lib/cou"]
