[501.092179, "o", "    <div class=\"\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K\" aria-label=\"1.11.18\">\r\nWe feel it shares significance with this Chamilo \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K because, as we are preparing for a gigantic jump forward in development as we are nearing the release of the Chamilo 2.0 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K, it is also the chosen site for an infamous electric automaker to lay foundations of their massive European factory, which will highly contribute to make our civilisation jump out of the fossil fuel era and into era of shared prosperity, as we believe Chamilo 2.0 (and subsequent \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks) will massively increase the potential for Open Source software to help develop equalitarian education for all.</p>\r\n        Many vulnerabilities (more than in any previous \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K) have been reported to us (see <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/projects/1/wiki/Security_issues\">our security page</a>) and swiflty and safely fixed. Thanks to all white hat hackers for helping us out (see their nicknames on the page).<br />\r\n        We actively encourage all Chamilo administrators to update their system to this \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K as soon as possible.\r\n"]
[501.100322, "o", "            <li>[2022-05-03] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/68d72ab38d14d39d18c22cc7522bde7aefd742db\">68d72ab3</a> - <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/issues/42685\">CT#42685</a>) Admin: Add configuration setting 'password_con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K' for password con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K during login if password encryption has changed</li>\r\n"]
[501.106328, "o", "            <li>[2022-12-22] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/e6ef1eb41be5d8f8eab8345c79c6c3a881925b66\">e6ef1eb4</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/20451\">BT#20451</a>) Plugin: IMS/LTI: Set LTI 1.3 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K as default</li>"]
[501.119299, "o", "\r\n            <li>[2022-12-08] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/2b490f2951a6637a0e2cdcc754e1cc1f1135f796\">2b490f29</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/20407\">BT#20407</a>) Authentication: Single Sign On CAS: updating parameters and requierement to comply with security update of phpCAS \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K 1.6 to fix high severity issue GHSA-8q72-6qq8-xv64</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-11-02] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/c69c79026392190b9cd8ed4533f8589545fe9dda\">c69c7902</a>) Internal: Fix xhprof loading for new Tideways library \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-11-01] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/a12db5d351492fcde8065aaaa7d915f7ac6750f4\">a12db5d3</a>) Internal: Fixed mixed code from previous old \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-09-28] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/bcc69979eb955f4e76d28955d53d73b8bc59894a\">bcc69979</a>) Install: Set \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 1.11.18 dev in \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K.php</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-08-03] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/50787c47f97f016af80b0270d95393718735a7f3\">50787c47</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/19479\">BT#19479</a>) Plugin: Zoom: Bump to \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K 0.5</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-07-01] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/473865a34c4e8bebb7f69c51cb12b466e1b67ad3\">473865a3</a>) Internal: Fix password encryption con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-04-27] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/171a32e1f087bbf656f361dd800165a4a7e0baf2\">171a32e1</a>) Plugin: BigBlueButton: Bump \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 2.11</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-02-14] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/7390cf2b26aefb85f4b97d408a64be2e98ca12be\">7390cf2b</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/19479\">BT#19479</a>) Plugin: Zoom: Update readme file to update \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-12-14] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/c699f6e02bc726e1488e52b4c5ed4650ae9df3f8\">c699f6e0</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/19501\">BT#19501</a>) Calendar: Fix error with recent \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of PHP and Maria DB causing error with white space around column's names</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-10-28] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/fccf1b3fcf2c07682864f9efa413987744e02f5f\">fccf1b3f</a>) Plugin: BBB: Bump \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 2.10</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-10-15] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/1dff02247ac375a791e601fc7e43df5a030f830b\">1dff0224</a>) XAPI: Bump \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 0.2 with update notes</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-09-23] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f3ae8afe5c3299df003480ede4f7514843397a46\">f3ae8afe</a>) System: Fix: Bump \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 7.0, in sync with changelog</li>\r\n            <li>[2022-10-07] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/6e8811c205c9e76b16e8171b40b579681b8587d9\">6e8811c2</a>) Webservice: SOAP: PPT2LP: Remote call upgraded to recent \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of NuSOAP in 'wsConvertPpt' service</li>\r\n    <div class=\"\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K\" aria-label=\"1.11.16\">\r\n        Many vulnerabilities (more than in any previous \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K) have been reported to us (see <a href=\"https://support.chamilo.org/projects/1/wiki/Security_issues\">our security page</a>) and swiflty and safely fixed. Thanks to all white hat hackers for helping us out (see their nicknames on the page).<br />\r\n        We actively encourage all Chamilo administrators to update their system to this \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K as soon as possible.\r\n"]
[501.123122, "o", "        initially installed with a \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K prior to year 2016. If you are in this case, you will need to\r\n            <li>[2021-04-07] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/9d305a68973db0aadf43eac59f3481b125754fdc\">9d305a68</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/3842\">GH#3842</a>) Documentation: Remove deprecated PHP \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks support from installation guide</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-03-01] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/584efc22617faecea6c1df41bc9cc59fc63ea733\">584efc22</a>) Documentation: Remove PHP 5.6 from allowed PHP \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks in dependencies guide</li>\r\n            <li>[2021-02-10] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/a062eebbf699a4b2eb40292b3f92c54f74879c3e\">a062eebb</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/18201\">BT#18201</a>) Portfolio: Remove XSS (same-\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K fix, so not reported in security issues)</li>\r\n            <li>Pixlr (image edition from the documents tool) service has been disabled due to introducing security issues in Chamilo. We hope to provide a suitable replacement in future \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks.</li>\r\n    <div class=\"\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K\" aria-label=\"1.11.14\">\r\n            <li>[2020-11-28] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/6a4fe3be6651fa43c2e521f7c6ce76a1e903b9fd\">6a4fe3be</a>) Internal: Fix Chash \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K use 0.2.x (PHP > 7.1 support for latest chamilo 1.11.x) Instead of 0.1.x</li>\r\n            <li>[2020-11-27] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/38dbc98729bd52b47663ecba0235067a9dda14b1\">38dbc987</a>) Internal: Update Doctrine \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K composer.json, fix user creation WIP</li>\r\n        <div class=\"\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K\" aria-label=\"1.11.12\">\r\n            Correspondingly, Chamilo 1.11.12 is a solid but minor \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of Chamilo, which comes (much later than\r\n            initially planned) at the end of a long series of 1.* \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks.<br />According to plans, it should not\r\n            our most successful \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks yet, delivered to our community and owned by them as per our license,\r\n            a bit like a crowdfunding project.<br />This \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K should be a stepping stone before \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K 2.0,\r\n            already well in the works but still months away at the time of releasing this \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K.\r\n            <li>[2019-08-07] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/6588a378778a9d2d5531dec5255ac5cb290aa7d4\">6588a378</a>) Internal: Upgrade require PHP \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 5.6</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-07-17] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f1ab4dc873ace9516bd47677eddddfdba5144736\">f1ab4dc8</a>) Admin: Add double \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K information in system status page to make it easier to know the \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of the platform.</li>\r\n"]
[501.124154, "o", "            <li>[2020-05-05] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/911c9e983d83d3c9febec750cbb368293c0237a1\">911c9e98</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/17165\">BT#17165</a>) Plugin: LTI: Bump plugin \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 1.8.0</li>"]
[501.126767, "o", "\r\n"]
[501.153639, "o", "            <li>[2020-01-30] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/3d1dcd91f345682f27ecfaa74e073fb168eca28f\">3d1dcd91</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/16110\">BT#16110</a>) Document: Tolerate spaces in filenames if the '+' \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K is not found</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-12-27] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/7d142050f4b49a47f2b7f85dddec8585c18fe07d\">7d142050</a>) Internal: Fix CI issue with PHP \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K < 7.2 and PHPUnit \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K == 8.4</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-12-18] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/deb4787b357a7a5b85909fe80d40e8b45b68873a\">deb4787b</a>) Internal: Update multi-url con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K script</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-08-06] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/6db3dffdbb1fcb90a7f98140361cdcad7472bc41\">6db3dffd</a>) Internal: Update PHP \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 5.6 in composer.json</li>\r\n            <li>[2020-07-21] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/b6a6d2d9a6e7b5b76a7a962152b41b570a0f6132\">b6a6d2d9</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/2992\">GH#2992</a>) Display: Add SVG \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of tuning, plugin and cas icons</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-09-30] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f9db054155818623b478ec0519a5f2a9d913cf50\">f9db0541</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/16173\">BT#16173</a>) Display: Create 64 pixel \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of LP image</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-11-21] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/c5f0981f721544c5e204a5599efaf5d617cb9f6a\">c5f0981f</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/16388\">BT#16388</a>) Webservice: Con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of API test to PHPUnit test BT#16388</li>\r\n            <li>Due to the end of life of the \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of Doctrine ORM we use, a warning about a \"continue\" instead of a break in \"UnitOfWork.php\" line 2640 will appear on most pages if you don't disable Warning messages. You can also remove it by just editing the line and replacing \"continue;\" by \"break;\", safely. However, because this is in an official dependency of Chamilo, we cannot change it for you. The problem itself is not really a problem. PHP understands it, it just warns you because this type of syntax should be avoided. Nothing to worry about.</li>\r\n    <div class=\"\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K\" aria-label=\"1.11.10\">\r\n        <p>Chamilo 1.11.10 is a minor bugfix release on top of 1.11.8. Contrary to previous releases, this one has a large number of security fixes. We strongly recommend you update to this \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K as soon as you can. Most notable in this \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K are 2 new features in the survey tool.</p>\r\n            Links to this release of Chamilo are multi-facetted: this \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K cements features\r\n            of the 1.11 major \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K for years to come, its links to Belgium are important (main development area), it\r\n"]
[501.15629, "o", "            <li>[2018-08-23] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f23fa4b9c9a18045e9f1297b1fc50d48ac5450b7\">f23fa4b9</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/14747\">BT#14747</a>) Scripts: Add multiple-access-urls con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K script allowing for the con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of an existing single-url portal to the secondary url of a multiple-access-url portal</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-04-10] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/502bbf4baf7717507b54f2f352d997d1e5274992\">502bbf4b</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/2763\">GH#2763</a>) Internal: Add additional check for array-type labels (used for extra field descriptions) to avoid array to string con\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K notice</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-04-09] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/31e665410e237cc7ce9d3bb4c6ae763a949adb24\">31e66541</a> - <a href=\"https://task.beeznest.com/issues/15389\">BT#15389</a>) Display: CKEditor Markers Rolls: Use minified \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-03-29] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/c07b9958a4f53cabac8b4fcbf0bf9c0d29ab827a\">c07b9958</a>) Internal: Replace $(document).ready with shortcut \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-03-04] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/f77765fc6e8b1ec69eba0214a33b7096287f92b8\">f77765fc</a>) Install: Update \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K to 1.11.10 in \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K.php</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-02-14] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/c4db36c9ce27eea604a76ac1face57708f5e1edc\">c4db36c9</a>) Internal: Update bootstrap select to \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K 1.13.5</li>\r\n            <li>[2019-02-06] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/2f7dd282d4dcf882342f8a6a2ba03f8f77ebaa4b\">2f7dd282</a>) Internal: Update \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K and CHANGELOG.md</li>\r\n"]
