[501.160016, "o", "        we highly recommend you to update from previous \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks as soon as possible.</p>\r\n            are hoping to make after 1.11.8 to get out of the 1.11 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[Ks and into our restructured \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K 2.0.\r\n            <li>[2018-08-10] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/ee3614c2d6a729a25884d3d9c828e7a1e112e74c\">ee3614c2</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/2554\">GH#2554</a>) Privacy: Legal extra fields are saved if a change is detected #2554 New \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of legal will be created</li>\r\n            <li>[2018-08-09] (<a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/dfe8548b187ebeeb39c184c8970e2b98a70d455a\">dfe8548b</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/2503\">GH#2503</a>) Privacy: Show translated \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kversion\u001b[m\u001b[K of privacy terms sections titles</li>\r\n"]
